  {
   "key": "func CloudHealthScrubCoordinator.scrubInPlace()",
   "hash": "c04df44178e0bf75",
   "does": "Sync-off path: scrubs up to 10 ids from the head of the list, removing each finished one; at the first retryLater moves that id to the end of the list and stops, so a record that keeps failing does not block the rest; persists the remaining list and, when any was handled, the sync state (the rewritten records' versions) and logs the handled count.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Storage/CloudHealthScrubCoordinator.swift::func CloudHealthScrubCoordinator.remainingIds()",
